{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_title", "source_sha256": "399ad2eebea9e09f155889132587b60d6057e091cb15b76993b0fbced9d65c6b", "ja": "今も、まだ……", "zh": "现在也、依然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_synopsis", "source_sha256": "edfc34f5671951358643d174e51d9ed20038a8e81e80ec345cb1b2a427c75e32", "ja": "ライブツアーの最後を劇場公演で飾ることに\nなった春香。朋花とまつりから学びつつ、\n準備を進めた。そして未来の「もっとアイ\nドルになりたい！」という言葉が、春香の\nステージへの新たな夢をふくらませる。", "zh": "巡回巡演的最后一站定在剧场公演，\n春香一边向朋花与茉莉请教，\n一边推进着准备工作。此时未来的一句\n“我想成为更好的偶像！”，\n让春香对舞台的新梦想越发膨胀开来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3e2c29e985fcd36962dc486a65e879bc7ab43c9c2c19a34ef1d52c76fae76b72", "ja": "（春香は公演のレッスンのため、スケジュールの\n合間を縫って、劇場に通ってきている）", "zh": "（春香为了准备公演，正利用日程间的空闲时间前往剧场上课。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c974234671f3ee2fd62d2923e24f4f086abe5bf78e17b3d37f3b5b4b1e7bf92c", "ja": "（ただ春香が決めた、今日のレッスンの内容は……）", "zh": "（不过，春香决定的今天的练习内容是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "0f4496af8a6fdb3e518a0b32143ac4f14c66524f0c5f6153739e043001daa4ee", "ja": "うふふっ、かわいい子豚ちゃん達。私が導いてあげま\nしょう。さあ受け取りなさい、聖母の愛ですよ～♪", "zh": "呵呵，可爱的小猪猪们。就由我来引导你们吧。来，收下圣母的爱吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "03a06f79e8d4421585e7a2b568f9c5fb3f19590b981f66d489217fafb81dcc56", "ja": "うふふっ、いい感じですね～。\n春香さん、聖母の素質があると思いますよ～。", "zh": "呵呵，感觉很不错呢～。\n我觉得春香，很有成为圣母的潜质哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "630e59699efdd127b0ab74bdcb309d246ad188fee42fb8fc2a5ed4741d03e421", "ja": "楽しいお城にようこそ！　これからとびっきりの、\nパーティーを始めましょう！　……なのです！", "zh": "欢迎来到欢乐城堡！现在让我们开始一场超棒的派对吧！……就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "1c3f507cf7c805f243bbbdec9212713e315d5dffa1294633c2ce3ed859579488", "ja": "はいほー、上手なのです！　このまま練習を続ければ、\nいつか春香ちゃんも、本物の姫になれそうなのです♪", "zh": "嗨哟，做得很好哦！照这样继续练习下去，\n春香总有一天也能成为真正的公主呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2dc323372533bdac28142dddfe3d5506891c89355e8ce6c9584030153034f3c7", "ja": "たしかに、今の春香にはない雰囲気だけど……\nレッスンというか、ただの微妙なモノマネじゃないか？", "zh": "确实是现在的春香所没有的气质，可是……\n与其说是训练，不如说只是差强人意的模仿吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "ce000ad8b91c8cff4f83260a0c3287b6203b30d619155945f8a5dd1cf0dbd2eb", "ja": "うう、そうですよね？\nいいアイディアだと思ったんですけど～。", "zh": "呜呜，也是哦？\n我还以为是个好点子呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "bd2044b23a941620b66a3257eaee47fcd385da9e4db8bef3c582568772c3b601", "ja": "天空橋さんや徳川さんの魅力を学んで、\n公演に活かす……。思った以上に、難しそうね。", "zh": "向天空桥同学和德川同学学习魅力，\n并运用到演出中……看来比想象中还要难呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1009_p", "source_sha256": "68672b40fd73e768ff7304a046043708d39acaad86ce717aec4576f4500902e8", "ja": "表現の幅を広げるといっても、まつりと朋花の個性は、\nこう……専門性が高いしな。", "zh": "就算说是要拓宽表现范围，まつり和朋花的个性……怎么说呢，专业性实在太强了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "ee1e672695437c7005815bf0a37a93740a48dda97f430d548256e74886ae29d1", "ja": "もちろん、そう簡単にはいかないのです。\n姫は一日にしてならず！なのですよ？", "zh": "当然，没那么简单哦。公主可不是一天就能养成的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "aad949657ce7301331609c60d96f812ea4dc2bf2dad930f7302f3d45d2bdd6d2", "ja": "様々な愛の形があることも学んでくださいね～。\nお仕置きもまた、聖母の慈愛のひとつなんですよ～♪", "zh": "也请学习一下，世上有着各种各样的爱的形式哦～  \n惩罚也是圣母慈爱的一种形式哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "bcde731740c3679575eba4f968c6437caa014c4f8f53776f95dc82c6149ea4e7", "ja": "うう、ハードル高そう……。\nが、がんばるねっ！", "zh": "呜呜，感觉难度好高……  \n我、我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1013_p", "source_sha256": "baffb33835e7a1141e116f523a5a8c010295b3aa569337f080b462e5f79fa07c", "ja": "そうか……。無理するんじゃないぞ？", "zh": "这样啊……别勉强自己哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "28cf99d0ba222b6cf557e9668d60d5a4d86d9fab7fb1e6961319c369f67adcd6", "ja": "遅れました～！　うう、クツひも固結びしちゃった……\nあれ、みんな着替えてない！？", "zh": "迟到了～！呜呜，鞋带系成死结了……咦，大家还没换衣服！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "8167b0335e6e9ae3eb42a5818af773bd505ff6bf500ede5e3de901afe884c641", "ja": "あっ、未来ちゃん！　そうだ、未来ちゃんにも何か\n教わりたいな～。よろしくお願いします、未来先生♪", "zh": "啊，未来！对了，我也想跟未来\n学点什么呢～。请多多指教啦，未来老师♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "43e6cfa8f3efbf7353f1a50bf0871c214546a2c56e4768c77da738443a7cbeac", "ja": "へ？　私が先生って……なんのですか？", "zh": "诶？我当老师……是要教什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "75ca149c7b076dd84e75f9aec7b88c2b426ad9c2fdca4391094fd558170214bc", "ja": "春香は今、いろいろなアイドルの魅力を学ぶことに\n挑戦しているの。", "zh": "春香现在正在挑战学习各种偶像的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "b816453fdcd233b780dcfb49c10a25a7b122960f94face44e59f7edcd1e33846", "ja": "そうだ、未来ちゃんも見てくれる？\n私の勉強の成果！　やってみるね！", "zh": "对了，未来你也要看看吗？\n这是我学习的成果！我来试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "4c6c270bd251fdfbd53c21e4b54473dd3864f1cb5ee807dd39dab8403e5559c3", "ja": "うふふ……私の前にひれ伏しなさい。\nそしてすべてを受け入れるのです。愛の名のもとに！", "zh": "呵呵呵……都跪倒在我的面前吧。\n然后接受这一切。以爱之名！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "a595197dfeff004eb3270a2912a7e5d5b78940288c0ac871e35cee94d513da68", "ja": "そして、次に案内するのは夢とおとぎの国なのです！\n虹の橋を渡って、ボクと愉快なダンスを踊ろう！", "zh": "接下来要带你去的是梦幻的童话国度哦！\n跨过彩虹桥，和我一起跳欢快的舞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "df8f6aeacb1c553d2f6847f3cc51456020c47e97c04a2942f621e432d32da338", "ja": "……あれ？　なんか違ってきちゃったかも！？\nうう、ふたりともごめんね～！", "zh": "……咦？好像有点走调了！？\n呜呜，两位对不起啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "040b9242f82d3fad67caa6f2d8d1ba0943b9fec83984250fef14323ee65c0273", "ja": "確かに少し違ってしまいましたね～。\nでも、子豚ちゃんの喜びそうな雰囲気でした～♪", "zh": "确实有点不一样了呢～。\n不过，感觉小猪猪会很喜欢的氛围哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "ebae31abd4f28f21d303f7952691899bd630cfa78e74dab5d257ac6e99db7fed", "ja": "姫というより妖精さんだったのです。\nでも、かわいかったので問題ないのです♪", "zh": "比起公主，感觉更像是小妖精呢。\n不过很可爱，所以完全没问题哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "ebda31ade810841c9e47d8915854e80a4ba44a437c4882c051ccebcc8c6f0574", "ja": "わあ……なんだかわかんないけど、すごーい！\nやっぱり上手だな～。", "zh": "哇……虽然不知道是怎么回事，但好厉害——！\n果然好棒啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "5d009565e24d2762882d30ac33be5bc7fc917dd71a0a3dd4cd75a3b336b75420", "ja": "でも……どうしよう。私も何か、すごいこと\nしないと。えーと……ええっと～。", "zh": "可是……怎么办呢？我也得做点什么厉害的事才行。呃……那个……～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1027_001har", "source_sha256": "5c35e12fa81d097fd562f4d1ed1876eee38fe4aa1d9d029ff7df18d0e1e3861f", "ja": "あ、全然フツーでいいんだよ？　たとえば……\n未来ちゃんお気に入りの髪留めを教えてくれるとか！", "zh": "啊，完全普通一点就好啦？比如说……\n告诉我你最喜欢的发饰之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1028_p", "source_sha256": "495c7d75ba3f5737a0a6ca5b931234fe73dd8fd0dcb64a336e36333e9077512c", "ja": "おっ、素直にアイドルらしくていいんじゃないか？", "zh": "哦，坦率地展现偶像风采，不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "91d48be965821e0f5a63c0ac92dd171862e0099abcbf6a975fb0e4a91e42187a", "ja": "え～っ。素直っていうか、普通すぎますよぉ。\nそれに春香さんは、絶対リボンの方がいいもん。", "zh": "诶～。与其说是坦率，不如说是太普通了吧。\n而且，春香前辈绝对还是蝴蝶结更合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "a79b0b9bb02777802b5718a6965f170d29094dfa1faf3846ff27f5199a5d1842", "ja": "うーん、私が春香さんに教えられること……。\n私が、春香さんに……春香さん……。", "zh": "嗯——我能教给春香姐的事……  \n我，教给春香姐……春香姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "4ad7b652f10036724740a35edc4d02348f49955ef25b68b7f8ec6728bd209a19", "ja": "あのっ！　教えてほしいことばっかりで、\n全然思いつきません！", "zh": "那个！净是些我想向您请教的事情，\n我完全想不出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1032_001har", "source_sha256": "354c7c52009d4bdf8efbecb2e6c13bb62edac39cdec12cc47c4a21082bfe618f", "ja": "未来ちゃん……。ふふっ。", "zh": "未来……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "925d4d5090506cf269d6dc1eebdf27b0cd6b117611d44de8079b1040a39ce352", "ja": "一生懸命考えてくれてありがとう、未来ちゃん。\nうんっ、すっごく参考になったよ♪", "zh": "谢谢你这么努力地帮我想，未来。\n嗯，真的给了我很大的参考♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1034_014mir", "source_sha256": "fb30507b032b3b796cc42de75d2aefdfe15ac50a60593ba64a6a2fb46122fcdc", "ja": "あ、そうだ！\n春香さんっ、これ宿題にさせてください！", "zh": "啊，对了！\n春香小姐，这个就当作作业交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1035_001har", "source_sha256": "854d1daae1e1f9e900fb88cb9fe03ed67b5f2957225b9b68e2ab33893f7e02b0", "ja": "えっ、まだ考えてくれるの？\nでも私、今のでもう……。", "zh": "诶，还要继续替我想吗？\n可是，我刚才已经……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1036_p", "source_sha256": "8d888255b1e41bd4bde3ce78d68151930d9250246386df997ba002aceec95ad2", "ja": "いや、未来がそうしたいなら、いいと思うな。\nゆっくりでいいから、未来も考えてみようか。", "zh": "不，要是未来你想那么做的话，我觉得挺好的。\n不用着急，未来你也试着思考一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1037_p", "source_sha256": "b781d44312996bf4fc4a65177db21119d74b14daafe946c0a3ffec10b084e018", "ja": "アイドルとしての、春香のためになりそうなこと。\n未来が思う、アイドルの可能性が広がりそうなことを。", "zh": "对作为偶像的春香有帮助的事。  \n以及未来觉得能拓展偶像可能性的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "6b6ebc55dd54206ba3f3e51985ff65b04b515b8f664b51ebfbc3bf432b5e9953", "ja": "アイドルとして……。\nはいっ、春日未来、がんばります！", "zh": "作为偶像……  \n好的，春日未来，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1039_002chi", "source_sha256": "e2f4398e08ed3ad903437b69185d0aafc41307ba38f4537ebb961d77e91aeb91", "ja": "……。では、ここからは普通のレッスンを。みんな、\n着替えましょう。……あ、未来はクツひもを。", "zh": "……。那么，接下来进行平时的练习吧。大家先去\n换衣服。……啊，未来先把鞋带。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1040_001har", "source_sha256": "98b2899aa3cd11db7eb2a2612f0eff9ab3277f3c5ec6109ea9144caf7a752452", "ja": "あ、そうだよね！　見せて、未来ちゃん。\nほどいてみるから……わ、固そう！", "zh": "啊，对哦！让我看看，未来。  \n我来试着解开……哇，好像系得很紧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1041_p", "source_sha256": "62763c4f1683a425c19320307408ea3e9b856ad0c65b09429328792396fa433e", "ja": "（それから数日。春香のミニコンサートツアーも、\n無事にプレファイナルを終えた。次はいよいよ……）", "zh": "（几天后，春香的迷你演唱会巡演也顺利结束了预演最终场。接下来终于要……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1042_p", "source_sha256": "2a991880df0bff8c45b83bae259e18309e9501ba2ed6bcd9e640360d32bd8782", "ja": "お疲れ様、春香……って、あれ？\n千早、春香を見なかったか？", "zh": "辛苦了，春香……咦？\n千早，你有没有看到春香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1043_002chi", "source_sha256": "e08c2ec62b9e468cbfb783b7329d8373599bb08f0244dfae78c95c234050b01a", "ja": "さっきすれ違いました。衣装のまま手を振って、\nそのまま外に出て……。一緒ではなかったんですね？", "zh": "刚才和她擦肩而过了。她还穿着演出服挥了挥手，就那样出去了……原来你们没在一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1044_p", "source_sha256": "1e2a0d4c8b8d66bbcf178f4872f997092298d6c0a70fc976bc0eae07f7717fa2", "ja": "あ、いた！　おーい、春香！", "zh": "啊，找到了！喂——春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1045_001har", "source_sha256": "ff07732b2f6321a13f33aee07faa15d9d9d6e47cb8cfc7f199d3246166535fe3", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　千早ちゃん！\nここ、いい風吹いてるー……って、わわわわっ！！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！千早！\n这里吹过来的风好舒服啊～……哇、哇哇哇！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1046_p", "source_sha256": "22f72f32c6df28779615c055634aaad59878b29028ff396b3db35a27e02ba19e", "ja": "うわっ、転ぶなよ！？", "zh": "哇，别摔倒啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1047_001har", "source_sha256": "a545580693003e8304c6257ce6e160bc90a33ec450d2c979227abbd5333e28e3", "ja": "……とと。えへへっ、平気です！\n最近は衣装着てると、そう簡単に転ばなくて♪", "zh": "……哎呀。嘿嘿，没事的！\n最近只要穿着演出服，就没那么容易摔倒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1048_p", "source_sha256": "5f13d2ebe5664023f7fb84eb66a050c835118df9d26c7745c08f20565ce7865a", "ja": "おお、頼もしい……じゃなくて。\nこんなところにいると風邪ひくぞ？", "zh": "哦，真可靠……不对。待在这种地方会感冒的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1049_002chi", "source_sha256": "0799813e90da76086497b6c9f3737d7bc18030cbf6d50ffa54200b10270c7c62", "ja": "汗もまだ引いてないでしょう？\n楽屋に戻って、着替えた方が。", "zh": "汗还没干吧？\n还是回休息室换身衣服比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1050_001har", "source_sha256": "b7b16d2c1aa7b80edafbf0bfe01294e296dabd0e8c9299db0af585daeb04921f", "ja": "うん、そうなんだけど……えへへっ。\nなんだか私、すごくテンション上がっちゃって！", "zh": "嗯，虽然是这样啦……嘿嘿。\n总觉得我现在，情绪超级高涨呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1051_p", "source_sha256": "5246351082dba579ab8566597668983eddcb1d57cc03b4369be1d79202b7888f", "ja": "テンション、上がって……？\nファイナルはまだこれからなのに？", "zh": "兴奋成这样……？\n明明最终场还在后头呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1052_001har", "source_sha256": "9be6ce87c5be6bd8880d2e2261d94875005578678fb1fe3acdc14916b7cf3584", "ja": "だってすぐに、劇場での公演もあるんですよ。\nもう、じっとしてられなくて、待ちきれなくて！", "zh": "因为很快就要在剧场演出了嘛。\n我已经坐不住了，等不及了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1053_001har", "source_sha256": "5d6a93f7ec8b890a29d9824e1da7ee938bca3e6fe1b80ded6c19985b4a127abc", "ja": "そうでなくても、ツアーの最後はいつもドキドキするん\nです。つないできた気持ちが、ひとつになるみたいで。", "zh": "即使不是这样，巡演的最后也总是让人心跳加速。一路传递下来的心意，好像要在这一刻融为一体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1054_001har", "source_sha256": "5d37a1854e75dbf0a003232f56f71a5c18c0e8742b1538db1959b80d1ef1e264", "ja": "それが今回は、劇場でのセンター公演だから。\nなんだか私、とっても……とっても、楽しみなんです♪", "zh": "而这次又是在剧场举行的中心公演。\n不知怎么的，我真的……真的非常期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1055_002chi", "source_sha256": "8357d3a0410616b367d507700a8871ffec143a467c7db43fa3346fc6bc7be643", "ja": "春香……。", "zh": "春香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1056_014mir", "source_sha256": "0b8c585314975cdd14d215e613309ed3a5ddc99407b2b37246aa432dd006b89d", "ja": "春香さーん！！", "zh": "春香——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1057_001har", "source_sha256": "e0c9057b223562234cf457fc7e1c905f2dec9cd9fb92a532e5e6e9a6ac5248e5", "ja": "あ、未来ちゃん！　朋花ちゃんにまつりちゃんも……\nみんな、来てくれてたんだ？", "zh": "啊，未来！还有朋花和茉莉……  \n原来大家都来给我捧场了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1058_031tom", "source_sha256": "5aa0668894f1bf8a91c4dc95e2e21b81826fcba70df20aea3d0f1bb821948776", "ja": "可愛らしくも堂々としたステージ、拝見しましたよ～。\n練習した時より、聖母の慈愛を感じました～♪", "zh": "那份既可爱又堂堂正正的舞台表现，我都拜见过了哦～。\n比练习的时候更加能感受到圣母的慈爱了呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1059_021mat", "source_sha256": "a8816f1838c60dcc6b4191fe4f6cad3c192b2b4707d191a1747de07a5705183b", "ja": "みらくる・わんだほー！なステージだったのです！\n練習した時より、さらにステキだったのです！", "zh": "非常不可思议、太精彩的舞台了！\n比练习的时候还要更加棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1060_031tom", "source_sha256": "c74f9e1ff9dfa108b42650ad2391a7def9521e4fa54851509b9499f9f44fcc2a", "ja": "そうですね～。\n可愛らしくも堂々と、ですよね～？", "zh": "是呀～。\n既可爱又落落大方，对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1061_021mat", "source_sha256": "c91f92bf95d9f7dcc7403f100b3b13a9fd4e72d73b5572baef2e9efa5ddbfa68", "ja": "ほ？　ほ？　わんだほー・ほ？", "zh": "哦？哦？超棒的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1062_p", "source_sha256": "b443e2417071393115a191c0df2a16d716cafac4f54dda2b81f1a20d40818124", "ja": "……まあ、要するにモノマネ練習も、\nちゃんと効果があったってことかな？", "zh": "……总而言之，模仿练习也是\n确实起到了效果吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1063_001har", "source_sha256": "f0ee08ded4d0b8744216f2999565beab659a1e681fddec9836fa4decbe68d743", "ja": "えへへ、そうかもしれませんね。なんだか……\nまた、やりたいことが増えちゃいました♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，或许真是这样呢。总觉得……想做的事情又变多了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1064_014mir", "source_sha256": "802b76c662aa90c9fe9a28e6a6e62a1fca7c2f02c319f09e809a3ba1c1d9372f", "ja": "あの～。私はまだ、宿題ができてないんですけど～。", "zh": "那个～我还没把作业做完呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1065_001har", "source_sha256": "5b1372d9737cf9abc8a0e8c367738c72302f27b987a9e00cca79445f45e2558a", "ja": "え？　あ、未来ちゃんが教えてくれること？\nいいんだよ、ゆっくりで！", "zh": "诶？啊，未来会教我吗？\n没关系，慢慢来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1066_014mir", "source_sha256": "2fd7ff586038b8ac4fb12e245bd8cd0b0c7bdfd1762a2af6b323b3e4c8b59937", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます。\nでも、私……。", "zh": "好的，谢谢您。\n不过，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1067_014mir", "source_sha256": "d1ac9ad595d7567d6fb998c157244bb79ba23f85600d7bc1ec9613f00f368f5c", "ja": "今日の春香さんのステージを見てて、思い出したことが\nあって。それなら教えられるかもです！", "zh": "看了今天春香小姐的舞台表演，我想起了一件事。或许这件事可以告诉你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1068_001har", "source_sha256": "35d411126d479aad35062b7b5cf2150891feed3624da28b70cd6399a73a443b3", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとう！\nなんだろうな～。教えて、未来ちゃん！", "zh": "哇，谢谢你！\n会是什么呢～未来，快告诉我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1069_014mir", "source_sha256": "9f129d1b2c6a5fc9c47a14b3dcdb8778f4a4d85a980f125873f40d79ac8a1063", "ja": "あの～。こんなこというのヘンかもですけど。\nでも思ったんです。私……。", "zh": "那个～。我说这种话可能有点奇怪。\n但我还是忍不住在想……我自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1070_014mir", "source_sha256": "6c3122a138061245f81fc0bf3e1d91109746631a9c7d1984b6e96c8cf8b40032", "ja": "やっぱり、アイドルになりたいって。\nあ、今もアイドルですけど、でも……。", "zh": "我还是想成为偶像。\n啊，虽然我现在也是偶像，但还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1071_014mir", "source_sha256": "68592f62525c578e97d49699e3ee61a4ebe1629bdc2b4604a6c70fe3658f2194", "ja": "もっと、もーっと、\nアイドルになりたいって！！", "zh": "想要成为更加、更加厉害的\n偶像！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1072_001har", "source_sha256": "bddb25bf4f2ea602a088ca22642f675efe399bc6ff983bdee9deac3365e9deb5", "ja": "もっと……。", "zh": "更加……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1073_014mir", "source_sha256": "825647b26a25cab502c295b8e02498355fd5e4f13047afbdb4dc7ed60b0ac668", "ja": "あっ、ごめんなさい！\nやっぱりこんなの、参考にならないですよね？", "zh": "啊，对不起！\n果然，这种话还是没什么参考价值吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1074_001har", "source_sha256": "daf8d21521ca59d9816c6e1f36fba82a54f96a1e33dca6e65d7eb4fa4a80ed5a", "ja": "……ううん。そんなことないよ。\nもっとアイドルになりたい……素敵な言葉だと思うな。", "zh": "……不会啊。没那回事的。\n想变得更像个偶像……我觉得这句话很棒哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1075_001har", "source_sha256": "9e3f3bd62c8a7aca47fd14781ea2e6b936b19e08a57c43c6a058afd4540daa20", "ja": "だって今、私にすっごく響いてるもん。そうだ、\nもっと歌いたい、もっとステージに立ちたいって……。", "zh": "因为现在，这句话真的深深触动了我。对了，我还想唱更多的歌，还想登上更多次舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1076_001har", "source_sha256": "04d56e7458b26f358405ebda2b13dd7b64e29f950db79bfcc420d602c8a4b9fb", "ja": "もっと笑顔になりたい。もっとみんなと繋がりたい。\nもっとかなえたい。全部、私のワガママかもだけど。", "zh": "我想绽放更多笑容。我想和大家建立更多联系。\n我还想实现更多愿望。虽然这一切或许都是我的任性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1077_001har", "source_sha256": "7547479a0399b9cf691631a14ea3a34f173bec5aaefb0446a30c07b7fec4682b", "ja": "でも、全部かなえたい！\nもっともっと、みんなと一緒に、これからも全部！！", "zh": "可是，我想全部实现！\n今后也要和大家一直一直在一起，实现一切！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1078_014mir", "source_sha256": "25be76b8c9ffce3b15b046a3ea1187c8b40e119d556a5e9a218760d6fa1ba5b6", "ja": "わぁ……！", "zh": "哇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1079_002chi", "source_sha256": "67f9acbb7caf027a6231f6360df8cdf169ef4d335e0e877c19e054641a2d365e", "ja": "……そうね。とても我儘なのかもしれないけれど、\nでも……いいと思う。とっても。", "zh": "……也是呢。虽然可能非常任性，\n但是……我觉得很好。非常好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1080_001har", "source_sha256": "5b48b8585eba196a17efc91f0f43a963cdd9524051e1f429a73218cd4c4ac252", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとう千早ちゃん。\n未来ちゃんも、本当にありがとう！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你，千早。\n未来也真的谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1081_001har", "source_sha256": "10530e19a87eb55c8993aabfa8d1b152d1824cac1e9ebbb3950529433952c082", "ja": "というわけで、{$P$}さん！\n私、なんだか改めて、やる気満々なので……。", "zh": "所以说，{$P$}先生！\n我好像又重新干劲十足起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1082_001har", "source_sha256": "b23cb4362062c067424eb5aed83c75adeffcb11f296201a528f693900d5bdc71", "ja": "これからも、ワガママな私のアイドルプロデュース、\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "今后也请继续制作任性又自我的我的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1083_p", "source_sha256": "a5373244696f3298670d5646e08e617a0eeb477822c29647c5756e8e4cb2284d", "ja": "もちろん！　でも、ただのわがままだと、\nなんだか恰好がつかないから……。", "zh": "当然！不过，要只是任性的话，总觉得不太像样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1084_p", "source_sha256": "a45bf27749501e155617886645345be30ad7cd9a872c2fcfc10ab67cf1c7499d", "ja": "それは別に、夢ってことでいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "那就当作是梦想，不也挺好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1085_001har", "source_sha256": "0d71ad7c419baebaf2565402c945178821085902c0e5588b273b47039e35c03e", "ja": "夢……。えへへっ、そうですね。ずっと昔からの、\n私の夢で。今はもっとふくらんだ、私の……新しい夢。", "zh": "梦想……。诶嘿嘿，是啊。这是我很早以前的\n梦想。而现在它变得更宏大了，是我的……崭新的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1086_001har", "source_sha256": "8f394a8050d5e8da5c5e98a695723187175755fb744864973a47d6acc724e930", "ja": "それが、もっとアイドルになることです！\n……みんなと一緒に、もっと！", "zh": "那就是成为更出色的偶像！\n……和大家一起，变得更出色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1087_p", "source_sha256": "f8d39bad727506220381e256d8cbed47b1fe6180897622dc9196176870b5a537", "ja": "よし！　じゃあ春香の夢をかなえるために、\nとりあえず……着替えようか、春香？", "zh": "好！那么为了实现春香的梦想，\n总之……先去换衣服吧，春香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1088_001har", "source_sha256": "06b102db1a6eb671b325812dadb42b9bce2cc18dd257f20aed691ff252ee52b1", "ja": "え？　ああっ、そうでした！\n私ったら衣装のまま話し込んじゃって……。", "zh": "咦？啊，对哦！\n我居然穿着演出服就聊起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1089_021mat", "source_sha256": "fbd382e2453283e8095f5c6cd48f4999a94cb2795f3e500d44a8fb839f6c9657", "ja": "春香ちゃん、衣装のままで公園をお散歩するのは、\n姫としてははしたないのです。めっ！なのですよ？", "zh": "春香，穿着戏服在公园里散步，\n身为公主可是有失体统的哦。要知道这样不好哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1090_031tom", "source_sha256": "084e66ef931d90011d1767007710a67a395b795cfb930fc407a28cc22d09cc2f", "ja": "子豚ちゃん達へのご褒美は、然るべき場所で与えて\nあげないと、聖母としての節度が問われますからね～？", "zh": "给小猪崽们的奖励，要是不在合适的地方\n赐予他们，可就谈不上圣母的体统了哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1091_001har", "source_sha256": "09df2001e563c8643c3f981e0de15718bc68287fe721516c9f5b4ab22a1ae777", "ja": "うう、ふたりともごめんなさいっ！\n今すぐ着替えてきます～！！", "zh": "呜呜，你们两个对不起！\n我这就去换衣服～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1092_002chi", "source_sha256": "9a3890184ba9578841bd62bf82eb1fbf3f04907bc06aff08ed2e2959357ecfdf", "ja": "あっ。まって春香。走ったら……！", "zh": "啊。等等，春香。跑起来的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1093_001har", "source_sha256": "deea865748fe058b8fcb0ef23d4e127bb81802520c4e89e4398fced132c77591", "ja": "わっ、と、きゃああああああああ！！", "zh": "哇、啊、呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1094_se", "source_sha256": "e42a2bea12c3b3ac0b85f9dae24c108871ec19aa65c31a8d4168a161aa5ef3ce", "ja": "どんがらがっしゃーん！！", "zh": "（摔了一跤）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1095_p", "source_sha256": "a5a1cc378e604fbb006ac5b44179db7813b97bfa2b44509867b49208c1d5b8e6", "ja": "（夢に向かって進むことに、つい夢中になりがちな\n春香。その新しい夢は、現在進行形で拡大中だ）", "zh": "（春香总是容易一心扑在朝梦想前进这件事上。她的新梦想正在不断扩大。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_068_1096_p", "source_sha256": "df3b774329f510183c288a7200b51d6a3a68701a85b2f40f4007462415558f10", "ja": "（これからも、その夢をしっかり支えていくために。\nとりあえず、早く助けに行こう！　みんなと一緒に！）", "zh": "（为了今后也能好好支持那个梦想。\n总之，快去帮忙吧！和大家一起！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
